  "description": "“It’s normal.\" \n\n“So you thought it was normal for a crazy bastard to commit murder?” \n\nEugene couldn't say anything else because he was right when he said that he was a crazy bastard. Strangely, I only ever encountered this man in the worst situations, but I wasn't at all scared. \n\n“How about getting bitten by an abnormal cub once?” \n\n“How dirty is it?” \n\n“It’s probably dirtier and more dog-like than you can imagine.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/9228), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10378122), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5265000043), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000060284), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/hongkong_express), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230962)",
